<title>FRANCE: Jospin, Kohl to meet in Germany on August 28.</title>
<headline>Jospin, Kohl to meet in Germany on August 28.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Prime Minister Lionel Jospin and German Chancellor Helmut Kohl will meet in Germany on August 28, the French prime minister's office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A source close to the government said the meeting would probably be in Bonn.</p>
<p>French officials had said such a meeting would be a good way of consolidating Franco-German ties and reaffirming the commitment of both countries to launching a single European currency on time in 1999.</p>
</text>
